!!! archon/model/category.mat
!!! The surface under assessment.
!!!
!!! Archon is not only a code scanner. A finding names which surface it was
!!! observed on, so one report vocabulary covers source code, configuration,
!!! permissions, dependencies, runtime state and data.

book archon.model.category

read everything from ny.lang.core

public category begin choice
    when Code
    when Security
    when Permission
    when Configuration
    when Dependency
    when Runtime
    when Data
end choice

!!! A stable, lower-case name for machine-readable output.
public category-name receives domain as category returns text begin paragraph
    value name as text is consider domain
        when category.Code give "code"
        when category.Security give "security"
        when category.Permission give "permission"
        when category.Configuration give "configuration"
        when category.Dependency give "dependency"
        when category.Runtime give "runtime"
        when category.Data give "data"
        otherwise give "code"
    end consider
    give name
end paragraph
